{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.MarkovTraceClassicalLimit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.MarkovTraceClassicalLimit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Cycle.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Option","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Pi","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Quotient","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Group","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.SetTheory.Cardinal.Finite"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.not_landauer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.not_landauer","kind":"theorem","line":286,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L286-L292","doc":"**No braid-independent `E` makes `𝔪 · c = E · ln 𝔪` on the unknot and the 2-unlink, unless\n`[2] = 2`.** Here `t = [2]_q`, `c = c_q² ≠ 0`, and `L = ln t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_half_eq_trClassical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_half_eq_trClassical","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L263-L270","doc":"**The trace `z^{n − cyc}` at `z = 1/2` is the state count.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.two_pow_mul_trZ_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.two_pow_mul_trZ_half","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L254-L261","doc":"**`2ⁿ · tr_{1/2}(σ) = 2^{cyc(σ)}`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.zD_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.zD_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L250-L252","doc":"`z_D = q³/(q²+1)` is `1/2` at `q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_markov","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L241-L248","doc":"**Markov property** of `tr_z` with parameter `z`: adding a strand and crossing it multiplies\nthe trace by `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_mul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_mul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L234-L239","doc":"**Cyclicity** of `tr_z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_one_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ_one_perm","kind":"theorem","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L230-L232","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trZ","kind":"def","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L225-L227","doc":"**The trace `tr_z(σ) = z^{n − cyc(σ)}`**, for any `z` in any commutative ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_conj","kind":"theorem","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L221-L223","doc":"Conjugation does not change the number of cycles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_markovMove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_markovMove","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L217-L219","doc":"The Markov move does not change the number of cycles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_eq_of_card_states_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_eq_of_card_states_eq","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L210-L215","doc":"Two permutations with equally many states have equally many cycles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_le_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles_le_card","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L205-L208","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.cycles","kind":"def","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L201-L202","doc":"The number of cycles of `σ`, fixed points included (= components of the closure). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_markov","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L177-L183","doc":"**Markov property with parameter `1/2`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesMarkov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesMarkov","kind":"def","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L140-L175","doc":"States of the Markov move are states of `σ`: the new strand's bit is forced\nto equal strand `a`'s. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.markovMove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.markovMove","kind":"def","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L135-L138","doc":"The Markov move: embed `σ` in one more strand (the new strand is `none`)\nand cross strand `a` with the new one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_mul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_mul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L129-L133","doc":"**Cyclicity** `tr(στ) = tr(τσ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesConj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesConj","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L118-L127","doc":"Conjugation moves states by relabelling the strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical_one","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L109-L116","doc":"The trivial braid has every colouring as a state. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.two_pow_mul_trClassical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.two_pow_mul_trClassical","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L100-L107","doc":"`2ⁿ · trClassical σ = 2^{c(σ)}`: the classical mass counts bits. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.card_states_eq_two_pow_cycles","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.card_states_eq_two_pow_cycles","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L94-L98","doc":"**`#states(σ) = 2^{c(σ)}`**, `c` the number of cycles, fixed points included. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesEquivCycleColourings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.statesEquivCycleColourings","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L82-L92","doc":"**States are colourings of the cycles.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.state_zpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.state_zpow","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L63-L80","doc":"An invariant colouring is invariant under every integer power. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.trClassical","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L58-L60","doc":"The classical trace: the number of states over `2ⁿ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.States","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.ClassicalTrace.States","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/MarkovTraceClassicalLimit.lean#L55-L56","doc":"States of `σ`: two-valued colourings of the strands invariant under `σ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}